1
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:14,048
I love old films and my family loves them, too.

2
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:28,220
My mum and dad always talk about a really old film called Swiss Family Robinson, also a book, about a Swiss family who find themselves on a desert island when their boat sinks.

3
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,100
And do you know what?

4
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:31,660
I like it, too.

5
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,780
So guys – here’s today’s topic.

6
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,320
Old films about families.

7
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:41,200
So you know my opinion, what about yours?

8
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:50,320
How about the Home Alone films in the 1990s, all about 8-year-old Kevin McCallister?

9
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:53,480
The first one is definitely the best.

10
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:59,160
Kevin’s parents forget to take him on the family Christmas holiday.

11
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:08,708
Kevin is happy at first because he’s got the whole house to himself and his brothers and sisters aren’t there to annoy him.

12
00:01:09,580 --> 00:01:15,198
He has lots of fun stopping two silly criminals from robbing the family home.

13
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:25,660
But he starts to miss his family and on Christmas morning he gets the best present of all – everyone comes back home!

14
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:29,740
It was funny then and it’s still funny now.

15
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:35,360
Whose favourite family is the Parrs in The Incredibles?

16
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:36,900
Remember them?

17
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:39,500
The Parrs are like most families.

18
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:43,380
You know, they fight and argue and have fun.

19
00:01:43,860 --> 00:01:46,340
But they’re also a family of superheroes.

20
00:01:47,620 --> 00:01:49,240
Dad is super strong.

21
00:01:49,842 --> 00:01:51,920
Mum is super stretchy.

22
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:58,820
Violet, their eldest child, can turn invisible, and then nobody can see her.

23
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:07,106
Her younger brother Dash is super fast and her baby brother Jack-Jack has laser eyes.

24
00:02:07,620 --> 00:02:10,821
I think those films are great, old or not.

25
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:14,620
I like your comments, Max and Emma.

26
00:02:14,620 --> 00:02:16,220
And here is mine.

27
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:17,820
The Addams Family!

28
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:22,629
They’re a really strange family who live in a normal town.

29
00:02:22,629 --> 00:02:24,200
They all wear black.

30
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:26,760
They live in a huge old house.

31
00:02:27,220 --> 00:02:32,340
Other families think they’re a little bit scary, but the Addams family don’t care.

32
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:40,460
The parents, Gomez and Morticia, and their children, Wednesday and Pugsley, are happy being different.

33
00:02:40,460 --> 00:02:43,180
And there’s Cousin It, too.

34
00:02:43,860 --> 00:02:48,340
He (or she – no one is sure) is covered in fur.

35
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:53,120
And finally there is Uncle Fester, Gomez’s brother.

36
00:02:53,660 --> 00:02:59,080
They’re one of the best loved screen families of all time – in my house, anyway!
